// # emit-x86 const two-string concat
//
// Logline: Print the concat of two string literals so emit-x86 can lower STRING plus STRING.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No hello fold.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Concat ab and cd.
//   3. Print the result.
//
// residual: general concat and calls stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println("ab" + "cd");
}
